  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Good Food on Montford</h3><h4 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">$$$<span class="sqsrte-text-color--lightAccent">$$</span> | <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/good+food+on+montford/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x88569e53f05e662d:0x41bd1dad58d9f5db?sa=X&amp;ved=1t:242&amp;ictx=111" target="_blank">MAP</a> | <a href="https://www.goodfoodonmontford.com/" target="_blank">WEBSITE</a> | <a href="https://www.instagram.com/goodfoodclt/" target="_blank">INSTAGRAM</a></h4><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Good Food on Montford is a small plates restaurant, which usually means leaving hungry and irritated. Not here. The plates are large enough to be satisfying, and the menu doesn’t feel like it’s trying to be something it’s not. There are steamed pork buns, ricotta gnocchi, and even the occasional plate of beef carpaccio, all of which make for a meal that’s fun to eat rather than one you have to suffer through for the sake of culinary experimentation.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>Best for:</strong> Sharing plates without leaving hungry</p><p class="" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"></p></div>


  
